摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Mobile device capability plugin for DeepSeek Harness: MobileService seam, mock/mobile-mcp providers, agent tools (observe/open_app/tap/type/back), tiered execution policy","id":"gh:1344946170","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-mobile","slug":"Wike-CHI/dsh-mobile","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Mobile device capability plugin for DeepSeek Harness: MobileService seam, mock/mobile-mcp providers,"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" agent tools (observe/open_app/tap/type/back), tiered execution policy"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"﻿# dsh-mobile"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Give your DeepSeek Harness agent eyes and hands on a phone.**\ndsh-mobile is a mobile device capabi"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"lity plugin: the agent observes the live screen as a\nstructured UI tree (no screenshots, no vision m"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"odel, zero image tokens) and acts through\nfive safe tools — observe, open app, tap, type (draft only"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"ro image tokens) and acts through\nfive safe tools — observe, open app, tap, type (draft only), back."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文文档"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Demo placeholder** — a 30s GIF of the agent driving a real Android emulator goes here.\n> This is"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" the single highest-conversion asset; record one before promoting."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why not screenshots?"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Most phone-agent stacks feed screenshots to a vision model: slow, expensive, and brittle.\ndsh-mobile"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" drives apps from the native **accessibility tree** via\nmobile-mcp:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Fast** — one observe returns the full UI element list in milliseconds\n- **Cheap** — structured t"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ext, no image tokens\n- **Reliable** — semantic taps by element id/text, not fragile coordinates"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## The loop"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Status"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- ✅ **Phase 1** — MobileService capability seam, mock provider, 5 agent tools, context/policy contra"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"cts\n- ✅ **Phase 2** — MobileMcpProvider over the MCP protocol, verified on a real Android emulator\n("},{"id":"p12s3","text":"2026-08-22, Medium_Phone_API_36.0 / emulator-5554: devices → observe (28 elements) →\nopenApp Setting"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"s → observe (69 elements) → semantic tap 'Apps' → ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND error path → back)\n- ⬜ **Phase 3"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"** — `mobile_swipe`, screenshot observation, foreground-app awareness (ADB provider), multi-device\n-"},{"id":"p12s6","text":" ⬜ **Phase 4** — Tier-3 send capability (approval-gated), retrieved memory (contacts/conversation su"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"se 4** — Tier-3 send capability (approval-gated), retrieved memory (contacts/conversation summaries)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Out of scope**: auto-chatting, contact memory, WeChat/RED and other app-level automation."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Tool | What it does |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `mobile_observe` | Foreground app + normalized UI element list (read-only) |\n| `mobile_open_app` |"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" Launch an app by package name or alias |\n| `mobile_tap` | Tap by element id / exact text (coordinat"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"es as last resort) |\n| `mobile_type` | Enter a **draft** only — never sends, submits, or publishes |"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"\n| `mobile_back` | Press the device back button |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Safety by design"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Externally consequential actions (sending messages, posting, paying, deleting accounts)\nare **denied"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" by policy** unless the user explicitly authorizes them:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Tier 0–4 permission model** — guard-level hard rejects + pre-execute asks\n- `mobile_type` enters"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" drafts only; publishing is out of reach of the tool surface\n- Every tool result is structured and a"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"only; publishing is out of reach of the tool surface\n- Every tool result is structured and auditable"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Optional configuration (the plugin row in the profile's `cordis.yml`):"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Real-device verification (Phase 2)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Acceptance"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"> Given \"check my phone's current state\", the agent picks `mobile_observe` on its own,\n> receives a "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"structured ScreenState, and correctly explains the current UI."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Apache-2.0"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
